  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Phase2Dialogue NG+ 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: Okay...okay! Calm down a sec! *Huff...huff* turns out...being a pig for
      years...can make you weak.
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: Whew...*huff...huff* I thought...since I turned into you...this would be
      a piece of cake...but apparently that's not how this works.
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: I...have said that before, haven't I?
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: Well, shit.
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: I need to go back, I may have great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-grandkids,
      you know?
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: 'Don''t you have any empathy? '
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: And let's be honest, you're a weird one, I bet there's nobody waiting for
      you out there, son.
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: Do a solid for your boy Humberto and just go down, won't you?
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: Thanks. Let's go.
